# Spikeshell Harrier: "When this creature enters, return target creature or Vehicle an opponent controls to its owner's hand. If
# that opponent's speed is greater than each other player's speed, reduce that opponent's speed by 1." Bot2 casts Burnout
# Bashtronaut (speed 1, CR 704.5aa) and Bolts Bot1 on turns 2 and 4: speed 3 (CR 702.179d). Bot1 has no speed (0, CR 702.179f), so
# on turn 5 the Harrier bounces the Bashtronaut and slows Bot2 to 2, by exactly one. It is the only legal target (Bot2's Mox Jet
# is no creature or Vehicle, and the Harrier itself is no opponent's), so the trigger targets it without asking.

